Package: ALDEx2.jl
Type: Package
Title: R Interface to ALDEx2.jl - Julia Implementation of ALDEx2
Version: 1.0.0
Author: Mark Pampuch
Maintainer: Mark Pampuch <markpampuch@gmail.com>
Description: R interface to the Julia implementation of ALDEx2 (ANOVA-Like Differential Expression) 
    for compositional data analysis. This package provides high-performance differential 
    abundance analysis for microbiome and other compositional datasets using Julia's 
    computational capabilities through the JuliaCall package.
License: MIT
Depends: R (>= 3.6.0)
Imports: JuliaCall (>= 0.17.0)
Suggests: testthat, knitr, rmarkdown
URL: https://github.com/markpampuch/ALDEx2_jl
BugReports: https://github.com/markpampuch/ALDEx2_jl/issues
RoxygenNote: 7.1.0
